ra</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>van Gijn</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Xanthochromia after subarachnoid haemorrhage needs no revisitation</article-title><source>J Neurol Neurosurg Psychiatry</source><year>1989</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>826</fpage><lpage>808</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2769274</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pagani</surname><given-names>LF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The rapid appearance of papilledema</article-title><source>J Neurosurg</source><year>1969</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>247</fpage><lpage>249</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5780896</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Spalton</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hitchings</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name></person-group><source>Atlas of Clinical Ophthalmology</source><year>2005</year><edition>3</edition><publisher-name>Elsevier MOSBY</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Levin</surname><given-names>BE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The clinical significance of spontaneous pulsations of the retinal vein</article-title><source>Arch Neurol</source><year>1978</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>37</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">619871</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hallgren</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Terent</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wide</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergstr&#x00